  m_Name: Q1_OSInstall
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::QuizQuestionData
  questionText: Before installing an operating system, what should you check first
    in BIOS/UEFI?
  choices:
  - The boot order/boot priority
  - The desktop wallpaper
  - The web browser version
  - The printer driver
  correctChoiceIndex: 0
  points: 10
  explanation: The boot order must be set so the computer boots from the USB/DVD
    installer instead of the internal drive, or installation setup will never start.
